LanguageData.RebuildUntilLegendary.GizmoDesc:
Keep rebuilding this building until it reaches the chosen quality.

A finished building below the target quality is automatically deconstructed and a fresh blueprint is placed on the same spot, with the same material, style and rotation. The toggle switches itself off as soon as the target quality (or better) is built.

