LanguageData.RebuildUntilLegendary.StopGizmoDesc:
Stops the automatic rebuild loop for this spot.

Target quality: {0} or better
Builder: {1}
Attempts so far: {2}

The current blueprint or frame stays and can be finished by anyone.
